  "ruleText": "Bar 101.16 “Disinfect” means killing bacteria and viruses on objects and surfaces with an EPA-registered disinfectant.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Bar 100) #6046-a, eff 6-1-95, EXPIRED: 6-1-03\n\nNew. #7932, eff 8-3-03; ss by #10412-A, eff 9-19-13; renumbered by #13810 (formerly Bar 101.11); ss by #14459, eff 1-1-26 (formerly Bar 101.09)",
